boolean is_solid(ivec3 pos) ->
Returns true if the given position contains a solid voxel.
Out of bounds positions invoke undefined behavior.

integer get_floor(ivec3 pos) ->
Returns the Z position of the first solid voxel along {x=<var>pos</var>.x, y=<var>pos</var>.y}
with a Z greater than or equal to <var>pos</var>.z. Returns 64 if no voxels
below <var>pos</var>.z are solid.

integer get_col_top(ivec3 pos) ->
Returns the Z position of the last consecutive solid voxel along {x=<var>pos</var>.x, y=<var>pos</var>.y}
with a Z less than or equal to <var>pos</var>.z. Returns <var>pos</var>.z if <var>pos</var> is not solid.

color get_map_block_color(ivec3 pos) ->
Returns the color of the voxel at the given position.
If the voxel is not <a href=#is_solid>solid</a>, return value is implementation-defined.
Out of bounds positions invoke undefined behavior.

